  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This Florida cottage is located close to the spectacular South Walton beaches, Gulf Place shopping, artist's colonies, eclectic shops and restaurants of 30A. This tastefully decorated, fully appointed home features 3 private bedrooms: downstairs master with king bed and 2 upstairs bedrooms both with queen size beds; a plush queen size air mattress with foam topper for extra guests; downstairs master bath with walk-in shower; 2 full baths upstairs (one with soaker tub and walk-in shower) and half bath downstairs. The spacious living and dining area and open kitchen are flooded with natural light and furnished for relaxation and comfort. Two outside areas (front porch and back patio) are designed for reading a book, grilling out, or just relaxing. TV's with satellite in living room and all 3 bedrooms; internet; fully stocked kitchen; quality linens; washer and dryer closet. Located just a short walk (approximately 1/2 mile) to one of the area's most pristine beaches with public access. <br><br>Perfect for retirees, families, girls' weekends and couples' getaways, Seaside Serenity is ideal for those who enjoy fishing, paddle boarding, soaking up the sun at beautiful beaches of 30A, browsing shops, playing golf, and discovering favorite local eateries. It is a cheerful and restorative alternative to the hectic hubbub of busy beach resorts.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Beautiful Beach Cottage near Gulf Place and Spectacular Beaches of 30A"
        }
      ],
